@ 10.1.1.3 - Proto-Bali-Sasak-Sumbawan to Sumbawan
# citation: TinyMusic, from Adelaar, Alexander (2005), “Malayo-Sumbawan”. Oceanic Linguistics 44(2):357 – 388 “[C]ontraction of adjacent vowels” (not in Besar)
	h > q / _# (might’ve been a retention?)
	h > ∅
	w > ∅ / i_#
	ej ow > e o / _#
	u i > o e / sometimes
	V(h) > V(q) / _# (again, might’ve been a retention?)
	S:[+voice] > ∅ / _N
	S:[+voice] > ∅ / N_
	u > i / _{s,t,r,n,l} (blocked in Pusu)
	b > ∅ / medial (sporadic)